OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Monday, before
OL,7,Fshowers and perhaps thunderstorms
OL,8,Fdevelop overnight and into Tuesday.
OL,9,FFeeling warmer, particularly in the
OL,10,Fsunshine. Unsettled with further
OL,11,Fshowers likely Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
